{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんこんばんたん( •ㅈ• )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は8/21乃木坂46結成"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1周年です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1周年たっていろいろ振り返って"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みると、19年間生きて来た中で"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"間違いなく1番色濃い1年に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なりました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どこでもいる普通の高校生。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも8/22からはまったく"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今までとは違った生活に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なりました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ダンスのレッスン"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ボイストレーニング"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"演技のレッスン。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どれもこれも初挑戦で"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"特に1番辛かったのはダンス。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"行きたくない日もありました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ですが苦手なものを克服"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しないといつまでも出来ないまま"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"になってしまう。普通の高校生"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だったらそのままでも良かった"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かもしれない。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だけど、あたしは乃木坂46という"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アイドルです。アイドルにとって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ダンスは必須。だから克服"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しなきゃだめだったから学校も"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あったけどほとんど休まずに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"通ったし家でもいっぱい練習した。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その結果今でもやっぱり皆よりは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"覚えとかも遅いしへたっぴだけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全然苦じゃないしダンスが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しくなりました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂46に入ってたくさんのことを"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"経験させてもらって精神面も外見も"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"凄く磨かれたと思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてもう2年目に突入です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初々しいしいままの乃木坂46は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうこれで終わりで、これからは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もっと経験を積んでどんな会場や"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どんな取材でもいい意味の慣れが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あったほうが緊張せずに斉藤優里"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"らしさは出せるんじゃないかな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてもっともっと坂を"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"登って行くの。33人で。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここまで乃木坂46が活動出来たのは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんのおかげです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだまだあたし達に至らないこと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もあるかと思いますが暖かく"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見守ってくれると嬉しいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからもあたしはどんどん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"成長していきたいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"立ち止まることは出来ないんです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当は1人でだって走り続けて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"行きたいのですがまだまだ未熟者。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんの力を貸してください。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"悔しい涙は流したくありません。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ずっとずっと嬉しい涙だけ流したい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんとは嬉しい涙を"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一緒に分かち合いたい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうそんな関係ですよね？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また明日から1歩前進。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/19/7275138/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たんにこにこ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たんたんたん ゆったんたん( •ㅈ• )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"_"}],"source":"archive"}